---
<Base
  lang="en"
  title="Fat-Tailed Gecko — Breeding and Care Guide | NS Reptiles"
  description="All about the fat-tailed gecko: origin, size, terrarium, temperature, diet and care. A calm species for beginners — NS Reptiles, Novi Sad."
  keywords="fat-tailed gecko, fat-tailed gecko care, fat-tailed gecko for sale, fat-tailed gecko Serbia, fat-tailed gecko Novi Sad, fat-tailed gecko terrarium, fat-tailed gecko diet, gecko for beginners, NS Reptiles"
  path="/en/animals/fat-tailed-gecko.html"
